AIR COOLING                 | LIQUID COOLING
----------------------------|----------------------------
Cost: Cheaper               | Cost: More expensive
Uses fan + heatsink.        | Uses pump + radiator.
                            |
Efficiency: Good            | Efficiency: Better
Suitable for normal gaming. | Better for heavy workloads.
                            |
Maintenance: Easy           | Maintenance: Moderate
Mostly dust cleaning.       | Needs pump/tube checking.
                            |
Noise: Moderate             | Noise: Usually lower
Fan noise increases with    | Pump and radiator fans
higher GPU temperature.     | produce some noise.
